ed_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T12:13:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041805","verified_at":"2026-10-25T16:24:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4953280-1847286114037062","game_id":"steam-4953280","kind":"announcement","title":"Groovekeeper is at Steam Next Fest! 🎵","summary":"Groovekeeper is at Steam Next Fest! 🎵 We're excited to be part of Steam Next Fest: October 2026! If you haven't tried Groovekeeper yet, now is a great time to jump into our free demo! Welcome to Your Record Shop Hundreds of vinyl records are scattered across the floor, waiting to find their place. Pick them up, sort them by genre, fill the shelves, and slowly bring order to the chaos. No customers. No economy. No time pressure. Just you, the records, and the music. Play the Free Demo The demo is","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:09:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037062","verified_at":"2026-10-23T20:26:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4953280-1845383656396330","game_id":"steam-4953280","kind":"update","title":"DEMO HOTFIX #3 — v0.0.4 🔧","summary":"Hotfix #3 for the Groovekeeper Demo is now LIVE! This update focuses primarily on save reliability and protecting your progress, along with an important improvement to make sorting records clearer. Save System ImprovementsImproved the overall save system and autosave reliabilityAdded additional save validation when exiting the gameIf a save fails while exiting, the game will now prevent the exit instead of risking lost progressA clear \"Game Saved\" notification is now shown after every successful","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T12:57:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396330","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4953280-1845383656390969","game_id":"steam-4953280","kind":"update","title":"DEMO HOTFIX #2 — v0.0.3 🔧","summary":"Hotfix #2 for the Groovekeeper Demo is now LIVE! This update focuses on making the demo more comfortable to play, easier to understand, and faster to interact with. What’s New in v0.0.3Added a new way to empty record boxes — hold the interaction button to pour the contents directly onto the floorChanged the name list in the top-left from a hold action to a toggleImproved the Auto Sort skill to make its behavior clearerAdded an on/off option for Auto Sort, so using it is now completely optionalFi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T10:35:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390969","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4953280-1845383656389716","game_id":"steam-4953280","kind":"update","title":"DEMO HOTFIX #1 — v0.0.2 🔧","summary":"Hotfix #1 for the Groovekeeper Demo is now LIVE! We’ve been going through the first round of feedback and have pushed a new update focused on making the demo smoother, clearer and easier to play. What’s New in v0.0.2Added a new in-game bug reporting and feedback toolGeneral performance and optimization improvementsSeveral UI and UX improvements across the demoAdded a new controller infographic to make the controls easier to understandVarious small fixes and polish Keep the Feedback Coming This d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T18:15:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389716","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4953280-1845383656387192","game_id":"steam-4953280","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO IS OFFICIALLY LIVE !! 🎧 💿","summary":"Official Demo for Groovekeeper: Sort the Record Shop is finally LIVE!You can now jump into the record shop, pull records out of crates, sort them by genre, discover rare records and enjoy the relaxing, stress-free gameplay for yourself.Play the Demo Now!The demo gives you a taste of the full Groovekeeper experience with hundreds of records to organize and the same core gameplay you’ll find in the full release.If you enjoy your time in the shop, adding Groovekeeper to your Wishlist is the best wa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T17:29:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387192","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4953280-1844751498226715","game_id":"steam-4953280","kind":"announcement","title":"THANK YOU FOR 2,000 WISHLISTS! 🎉🎧📀","summary":"THANK YOU FOR 2,000 WISHLISTS!! 🎉🎧📀We are beyond excited to announce that Groovekeeper: Sort the Record Shop has officially hit 2,000 Wishlists on Steam!Seeing a thousands of you excited to step into our cozy record shop means everything to us.Support Our Journey (Wishlist & Follow!)If you haven't yet, don't forget to hit Wishlist & Follow and share the shop with your friends!Stay tuned!Keep groovin',NoRyte Studios","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T07:26:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226715","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4953280-1840310314348223","game_id":"steam-4953280","kind":